                      (    forth6809.asm):06548         ; iterations (0->1->2->3->4->5, exiting exactly on reaching 5,
                      (    forth6809.asm):06549         ; not one iteration early or late) before writing. The patched
                      (    forth6809.asm):06550         ; back-edge offset is negative (-17), the same PATCH routine
                      (    forth6809.asm):06551         ; used for forward references handling both directions
                      (    forth6809.asm):06552         ; correctly based on relative position.
