                      (    forth6809.asm):08604         ; address (matching VARIABLE's own DOESRT0 behavior - BUFFER:
                      (    forth6809.asm):08605         ; shares it) and that VARHERE genuinely advanced by exactly the
                      (    forth6809.asm):08606         ; requested 10 bytes - not just that some space was reserved.
