                      (    forth6809.asm):09981         ; TSTLITERAL - unit test for LITERAL. Already used extensively
                      (    forth6809.asm):09982         ; as an internal helper throughout sections 3.8/3.9's own tests,
                      (    forth6809.asm):09983         ; but gets its own dedicated, direct test here too, per this
                      (    forth6809.asm):09984         ; section's own coverage. Compiles a known value as a literal,
