                      (    forth6809.asm):15402         ; SRCADDR/SRCLEN/TOIN, matching the established pattern from
                      (    forth6809.asm):15403         ; sections 3.8-3.12. ( specifically carries real bug-fix history
                      (    forth6809.asm):15404         ; (a stray value left on the data stack, confirmed and fixed via
                      (    forth6809.asm):15405         ; MAME in a prior session) that this section's own test verifies
                      (    forth6809.asm):15406         ; directly - the data stack is genuinely unchanged after a
                      (    forth6809.asm):15407         ; comment, not just that parsing advanced correctly.
                      (    forth6809.asm):15408         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
