                      (    forth6809.asm):16077         ; "/COUNTED-STRING" (255) immediately followed by "MAX-N"
                      (    forth6809.asm):16078         ; (32767) - the specific mechanism that once let COMPAREW's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):16079         ; X-clobbering read bytes from the wrong table entry, confirmed
                      (    forth6809.asm):16080         ; via MAME with the exact $4E4D symptom (per the code's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):16081         ; comment). Querying this exact pair again here means a
                      (    forth6809.asm):16082         ; regression of that specific mechanism would be caught, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):16083         ; just assumed still fixed from the comment alone.
                      (    forth6809.asm):16084         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
