                      (    forth6809.asm):16305         ; TSTTOOLS - tools word set tests (glossary section 3.18, 3
                      (    forth6809.asm):16306         ; words). WORDS depends directly on LATEST (confirmed via its
                      (    forth6809.asm):16307         ; own code) - redirected for this test, applying the same
                      (    forth6809.asm):16308         ; lesson section 3.17's own TSTEVALUATE surfaced. DUMP dumps a
                      (    forth6809.asm):16309         ; deliberately non-multiple-of-16 byte count (5), the exact
                      (    forth6809.asm):16310         ; scenario its own already-documented DUVALID bug fix addresses,
                      (    forth6809.asm):16311         ; and this section's own test specifically verifies the ASCII
                      (    forth6809.asm):16312         ; column's blanking for the unused portion, not just the real
                      (    forth6809.asm):16313         ; data. .S prints the entire real data stack, including whatever
                      (    forth6809.asm):16314         ; the calling chain already left there - unlike every other test
                      (    forth6809.asm):16315         ; in this session, the full output can't be predicted in
                      (    forth6809.asm):16316         ; advance, so this section's own test verifies the core,
                      (    forth6809.asm):16317         ; documented "non-destructive" guarantee directly instead.
                      (    forth6809.asm):16318         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
