                      (    forth6809.asm):16374         ; TSTDOTS - unit test for .S. Pushes two known values (no guard
                      (    forth6809.asm):16375         ; sentinel below them, since .S would print that too), calls .S,
                      (    forth6809.asm):16376         ; and verifies the stack is genuinely unchanged afterward - the
                      (    forth6809.asm):16377         ; core, documented "non-destructive" guarantee, confirmed
                      (    forth6809.asm):16378         ; directly rather than inferred. In interrupt mode specifically,
                      (    forth6809.asm):16379         ; also confirms the very first characters queued match the top
                      (    forth6809.asm):16380         ; value's own printed form (unambiguous, since .S starts from
                      (    forth6809.asm):16381         ; the current top of stack); polling mode only confirms some
                      (    forth6809.asm):16382         ; output occurred, given EMITCH alone can't distinguish this
                      (    forth6809.asm):16383         ; test's own output from whatever the rest of the real stack
                      (    forth6809.asm):16384         ; contributes afterward.
