                      (    forth6809.asm):17909         ; 217 generated entries) -> ... -> H_KEY -> 0. H_M2 is now the true
                      (    forth6809.asm):17910         ; head (see BASELATEST below) - H_FIND and the four number words
                      (    forth6809.asm):17911         ; were chained on after H_QUIT in a later turn.
