DF41 DD00             (    forth6809.asm):18151                  STD   STATE     ; below, running on EVERY line - including
                      (    forth6809.asm):18152                                   ; lines in the middle of a colon definition
                      (    forth6809.asm):18153                                   ; that spans more than one line of input.
                      (    forth6809.asm):18154                                   ; COLON (sets STATE=-1) and SEMI (sets
                      (    forth6809.asm):18155                                   ; STATE=0, after checking CSP) are the
                      (    forth6809.asm):18156                                   ; correct, sole places STATE should change
