E5DD DD74             (    forth6809.asm):19239         NQSTOREHI: STD  UDHI
                      (    forth6809.asm):19240         
E5DF                  (    forth6809.asm):19241         NQPOS32:  ; re-derive from CADDR whether the ORIGINAL last character
                      (    forth6809.asm):19242                   ; was '.' - determines which return convention to use
