E8D5 3706             (    forth6809.asm):19742         LOOPOK:  PULU  D          ; BUG FIX: was PULU X, then TFR X,D to retrieve
E8D7 3606             (    forth6809.asm):19743                  PSHU  D          ; it after CCALL/CODECOMMA below - but both of
                      (    forth6809.asm):19744                                   ; those clobber X internally (CCALL's own LDX
                      (    forth6809.asm):19745                                   ; CODEHERE, CODECOMMA's LDX #CODEHERE via
                      (    forth6809.asm):19746                                   ; APPENDCELL), so X no longer held the target
                      (    forth6809.asm):19747                                   ; by the time TFR X,D ran - it held the address
                      (    forth6809.asm):19748                                   ; of the CODEHERE variable itself, corrupting
                      (    forth6809.asm):19749                                   ; the branch displacement PATCH computed.
                      (    forth6809.asm):19750                                   ; Parking the target on U instead (untouched by
                      (    forth6809.asm):19751                                   ; CCALL/CODECOMMA, which only use D/X/A) keeps
                      (    forth6809.asm):19752                                   ; it safe across both calls; retrieved below via
