                      (    forth6809.asm):19754                                   ; via MAME debugger: the compiled displacement
                      (    forth6809.asm):19755                                   ; came out as +8, executing DOTEST's return to
                      (    forth6809.asm):19756                                   ; a near-zero, invalid address.
