F894 93AB             (    forth6809.asm):22063                    SUBD UEDST     ; overwriting whatever was left on top of
F896 DDAD             (    forth6809.asm):22064                    STD  UEOUTLEN  ; the stack rather than pushing both
                      (    forth6809.asm):22065                                   ; required return values, and separately,
                      (    forth6809.asm):22066                                   ; UEOUTLEN itself was never correctly
                      (    forth6809.asm):22067                                   ; tracked by the old backslash-decoding
                      (    forth6809.asm):22068                                   ; loop's own per-character bookkeeping in a
                      (    forth6809.asm):22069                                   ; way that accounted for doubled '%'
                      (    forth6809.asm):22070                                   ; characters. Now computed directly as the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22071                                   ; final write pointer (Y) minus the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22072                                   ; original destination address (UEDST) -
                      (    forth6809.asm):22073                                   ; correct regardless of how many characters
                      (    forth6809.asm):22074                                   ; were doubled, since it's derived from
                      (    forth6809.asm):22075                                   ; where writing actually stopped rather than
                      (    forth6809.asm):22076                                   ; incremented alongside it.
