                      (    forth6809.asm):22357                                  ; DDOT/DDOTR, i.e. . / .R / D. / D.R) were
                      (    forth6809.asm):22358                                  ; accidentally unaffected - each happens to
                      (    forth6809.asm):22359                                  ; run "LDD SAVEN" (a flag-setting load of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22360                                  ; true signed value) immediately before PSHU
                      (    forth6809.asm):22361                                  ; D/JSR SIGN, and PSHU doesn't disturb flags -
                      (    forth6809.asm):22362                                  ; but this was fragile, caller-side luck, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):22363                                  ; SIGN being correct on its own. Confirmed via
